<title>USA: CCC seeks 1,780 tonnes rice for Burkina Faso.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks 1,780 tonnes rice for Burkina Faso.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it was seeking on July 22 a total of 1,780 tonnes of U.S. long grain rice for donation to Burkina Faso.</p>
<p>The CCC, which is part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture, said the shipment period was slated for August 21 to September 5.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
